      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In 2024, this would probably be done via groups, although having invite-based events for friends would be cool too (i.e. the \"date with Rom\" example). For groups especially, having a new instance pre-configured and launched either at the event start or some time before-hand would be great too.\n\nMaybe make binding the event to an instance or world optional, so larger events can be coordinated. This system could then work simply for RSVP and, after accepting it, notifications.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
