      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this is a great idea, i would add:\n\n1) group events that are automatically added to the calendar to all members of the group of course with the option to opt out of those notifications.\n\n2) public group events that can be signed up for through the groups page\n\n3) friends only events that are created by sending a request to the selected friends for them to accept and add it to their calendar.\n\n4) creating events and reminders just for myself\n\n5) Events set by VRCchat for officially supported and promoted events like VKET, new years eve, etc.\n\n6) a discovery page for public group events to sign up for them like SHELTER for example without the need of being a member of said group",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
