      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've also thought about how nice it would be to have discovery like worlds have. It would help people learn about new groups, new worlds, and of course new events! Some smaller worlds that nobody visits that would be perfect for certain use-cases can start seeing the attention and use they deserve. In other words, musicians wouldn't have to always perform at the Black Cat to find new people.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
